{"id":"486408","name":"山药枸杞红枣鸡汤","author":"柳絮1982","authorId":"563830","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/486408/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"山药","amount":"半根"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大料","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡肉洗干净","img":"images/486408/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"水烧开，去血水。","img":"images/486408/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"重新拿一个锅，加葱花大料花椒。","img":"images/486408/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入鸡肉炖煮30分钟。","img":"images/486408/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"准备好的山药胡萝卜大枣枸杞。","img":"images/486408/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入锅中炖煮，一直炖煮熟。","img":"images/486408/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加盐酱油调味加入葱花香菜即可。","img":"images/486408/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/486408/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}